sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Tool as Postman or k6
    participant API as Backend API
    participant Metrics as httpMetricsMiddleware
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant Grafana as Grafana
    participant Alert as Alert Rules

    Dev->>Tool: Run smoke check or load test
    Tool->>API: Call API endpoint
    API->>Metrics: Observe request duration after response
    Metrics-->>API: Record histogram and counters
    API-->>Tool: Return API response
    Prom->>API: Scrape /metrics
    API-->>Prom: Prometheus text metrics
    Grafana->>Prom: Query p50, p95, p99 by route
    Prom-->>Grafana: Time-series results
    Alert->>Prom: Evaluate sustained latency and error rules
    Prom-->>Alert: Alert state
    Dev->>Grafana: Inspect latency dashboard and slow endpoints
